<title>SPAIN: Spain to cancel LPG price freeze in next few days.</title>
<headline>Spain to cancel LPG price freeze in next few days.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Industry Ministry confirmed on Monday that it would cancel a freeze on the price of liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) in the next few days.</p>
<p>&quot;In coming days we will cancel the freeze on prices,&quot; a spokesman at the Ministry told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said the decision had been taken because the measure had already played its part in limiting inflation.</p>
</text>
